DEC Compatible Wire-Wrap boards
<UL>
<LI><b>1highfront</b> is a single-height prototyping board for narrow DIPs 
up to 32 pins.</LI>
<LI><b>1high</b> is a single-height prototyping board for narrow DIPs 
up to 32 pins.</LI>
<LI><b>2high</b> is a double-height prototyping board for narrow DIPs 
up to 32 pins.</LI>
<LI><b>4high</b> is an Omnibus form-factor prototype card that will 
take DIP packages in narrow or wide form up to 42 pins.</LI>
